{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_AUTO","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":2300803,"initDialog":230080301,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[4016],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/IQ/Sumeru_23008/Q2300803","priority":5,"questId":23008,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":230080301,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"Akim","textMapHash":4163675906,"text":"Great! This is it. Give me a sec. I'll get it done in no time!","nextNodeIds":[230080302]},{"nodeId":230080302,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Black Screen","textMapHash":3388312138,"text":"A while later...","nextNodeIds":[230080303]},{"nodeId":230080303,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"Akim","textMapHash":716692570,"text":"Hah, my guess was right.","nextNodeIds":[230080304]},{"nodeId":230080304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"Akim","textMapHash":2134886586,"text":"As adhesive as it is, the moist soil breaks easily once it hardens. However, if we mix it with the Whopperflower soil, the solidified soil becomes more flexible.","nextNodeIds":[230080305]},{"nodeId":230080305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"Akim","textMapHash":911457322,"text":"It's just that the mixture can't really be molded before it starts solidifying...","nextNodeIds":[230080306]},{"nodeId":230080306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"Akim","textMapHash":510461058,"text":"But with the addition of the soil from the Slimes' habitat, the mixture can be molded much better before its solidification.","nextNodeIds":[230080307]},{"nodeId":230080307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"Akim","textMapHash":3937338570,"text":"I don't know what happened, but if I have to describe the process, the soil became Slime-like...","nextNodeIds":[230080308,230080309]},{"nodeId":230080308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3316592202,"text":"So, I guess we can call it \"Slimesoil,\" hmm?","nextNodeIds":[230080311]},{"nodeId":230080311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"Akim","textMapHash":1796101386,"text":"Some property of the Slimes seems to have affected the mixture in some way. That's why I was wondering if adding Slime Condensate would make it more effective.","nextNodeIds":[230080312]},{"nodeId":230080312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"Akim","textMapHash":817358642,"text":"And as it turned out, the mixture's plasticity and stability changed with the amount of Slime Condensate added.","nextNodeIds":[230080313]},{"nodeId":230080313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"Akim","textMapHash":1042157642,"text":"Which means that it can make more than just building materials, but pottery and many other things as well!","nextNodeIds":[230080314,230080315]},{"nodeId":230080314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":817457770,"text":"Congratulations!","nextNodeIds":[230080316]},{"nodeId":230080316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"Akim","textMapHash":1455559242,"text":"Thanks. I suppose this is what those wise folks mean when they say \"many a little makes a mickle.\"","nextNodeIds":[230080317]},{"nodeId":230080317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"Akim","textMapHash":1170935402,"text":"We shouldn't underestimate this modest-looking soil. Someday, I might be able to build a tower to touch the skies with it!","nextNodeIds":[230080318]},{"nodeId":230080318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"Akim","textMapHash":3831580570,"text":"I've also decided to call this mixture \"Concresoil.\"","nextNodeIds":[230080319]},{"nodeId":230080319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"Akim","textMapHash":746352386,"text":"The next thing is to see what this Concresoil can make...","nextNodeIds":[230080320]},{"nodeId":230080320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"Akim","textMapHash":3628248490,"text":"Ah, it seems that a possible solution to the problems that have plagued peoples' homes recently is within sight.","nextNodeIds":[230080321]},{"nodeId":230080321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4016,"speakerName":"Akim","textMapHash":2372816714,"text":"Thank you once again, Traveler. Please take these as your reward.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":230080315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1011578986,"text":"Your efforts finally paid off.","nextNodeIds":[230080316]},{"nodeId":230080309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2829646402,"text":"Sounds like something Paimon might enjoy.","nextNodeIds":[230080310]},{"nodeId":230080310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":342335322,"text":"Hey! Paimon doesn't eat soil!","nextNodeIds":[230080311]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2300803,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["42310","0","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_DAILY_TASK_VAR"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["42310"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_NOTIFY_DAILY_TASK"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUID